      "content": "Thanks for the detail. One thing that worries me is when someone is clearly being disruptive or acting in bad faith, rather than just making mistakes with their work. If I have an employee who is constantly undermining the team or creating chaos, how much weight does the documentation carry for those kinds of behavioral issues versus just skill gaps?",
